THE CONTENT — NOT COVERED BY THE ABOVE
    The hadith corpus is NOT licensed by this file and is NOT distributed with
    this repository. Its status is tracked separately:

      Book copyright        «الجامع الكامل في الحديث الصحيح الشامل» —
                            all printing rights reserved to the author
                            («جميع حقوق الطبع محفوظة للمؤلف», ج1 ص4),
                            published by دار السلام, Riyadh, 1437H/2016.
      Digital dataset       a Shamela text export supplied by the project owner.
      Redistribution        NOT GRANTED. No permission is on file.
      Commercial use        NOT GRANTED.

    Consequently the source files live in hadith_api/data/, which is
    git-ignored, and both content gates ship closed:
      CONTENT_LICENSE_CONFIRMED=false
      PUBLIC_DATA_ENABLED=false

    Running this software against a corpus you are not licensed to redistribute
    does not grant you the right to redistribute it. See reports/LICENSE_AUDIT.txt.
